* Dual regulator stand-in with channel 2 feedback and switch pins left floating
.subckt DUALREG VIN1 FB1 SW1 VIN2 FB2 SW2 RUN2 PGOOD GND
R1 VIN1 SW1 1
R2 SW1 FB1 1k
R3 FB1 GND 1k
R4 VIN2 SW2 1
R5 SW2 FB2 1k
R6 FB2 GND 1k
R7 RUN2 GND 100k
R8 PGOOD GND 1meg
.ends
V1 IN 0 4
XU1 IN FB OUT IN NC_1 NC_2 0 NC_3 0 DUALREG
RFB FB 0 1meg
RLOAD OUT 0 10
.op
.end
